# STRICT VISUAL REFERENCE RULE

All images inside `reference/ui/` are **APPROVED FINAL UI DESIGNS**.

Treat each reference image as a **visual specification**, not inspiration.

You MUST reproduce the corresponding screen as closely as possible.

## Brand

- Product name is **Imajica Medical Aesthetics** (logo may look like “Majica”; always spell **Imajica** / **IMAJICA** in code and copy).
- Design system: deep emerald, warm cream/ivory, muted gold, white.

